abstract: >
  Quality control tool for Avaatech XRF Core Scanner data.
  Implements five automated QC modules (QC1-QC5) with multi-energy
  support (10/30/50 kV), bilingual interface (EN/PT), and automated
  Quality Flag assignment by module-count.
